'''Northridge Point''' is a watchtower located in northern [[Northwind]] that has been taken over by a warband of [[orc]]s of the [[Blackrock clan]] led by [[Shuni Steeltooth]] that established a foothold in the region on the orders of [[Overlord Throkk]].<ref>[[Throkk's Command]]</ref>

